# The menus on a desktop (1280 x 800): how to play, the leaderboard, settings (cell numbers on, the color-vision palette),
# the profile (a display name and a rival typed in), the lessons list, the journey map, the Practice, Challenge and Daily
# setups, then a Practice round with its pause card, settings from the pause card, skip animations, a restart confirmed,
# undo, a hint, the tools by click and leave confirmed.
# viewport 1280x800@1
until 600 Paint the table
frames 10
save title
click =How to play
until 120 Hints & undo
frames 10
save help
